                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's fun enough if you're a fan of tower defense and want to pass some time. The difference between factions can sometimes be too small to be noticed. No serious strategizing is needed, so far early rush strategy (such as few units on the 2 top lanes and many units on the 2 bottom lanes) is enough to let me win semi-consistently. The base price is a bit high, knowing the PvZ GOTY edition also has the same price. Normally I recommend waiting for a sale, but SteamDB data shows last sale happened in 2017.\n\nP.S. This is a \"neutral\" review, I chose \"recommended\" because Steam doesn't offer option I'm looking for.",
